    "Id": "chassisdef_hercules_HRC-LS-9000_julius",
    "Name": "Hercules",
    "Details": "A uniquely customized Hercules created for Hauptmann Julius Walker of the Coventry CPM. The 'Mech's ER PPC, single Small Pulse Laser, and LB 10-X Autocannon were replaced by a massive LB 20-X with several tons of ammunition. Also, the techs added an additional Medium Pulse Laser, two standard medium lasers and CASE to the design.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.12</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
